<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Dev Environment Setup - 合集 | 奇风岁月</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/collections/dev-environment-setup/</link><description>独立开发者 Travis Bikkle 的个人博客</description><generator>Hugo 0.139.0 &amp; FixIt v0.3.15-fd15415b</generator><language>zh-hans</language><managingEditor>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</managingEditor><webMaster>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Tue, 19 Nov 2024 15:06:41 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://travisbikkle.github.io/collections/dev-environment-setup/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Kubuntu Vscode 鼠标列编辑设置</title><link>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/11/kubuntu-vscode-mouse/</link><pubDate>Wed, 15 Nov 2023 11:24:33 +0800</pubDate><author>zhaoyu025@gmail.com (Travis Bikkle)</author><guid>https://travisbikkle.github.io/2023/11/kubuntu-vscode-mouse/</guid><category domain="https://travisbikkle.github.io/categories/tips/">Tips</category><description>&lt;p>鼠标中键是某些操作系统的默认粘贴快捷键，这导致在VSCode中无法使用鼠标中键进入列编辑模式。&lt;/p>
